# Phase Boundary Summarize

After a roadmap phase (P0–P5) or declared milestone is verified, checkpointed, committed, and pushed — and before starting the next phase — run `/summarize`.

Capture: shipped scope, verify evidence, commit SHAs, remaining blockers/held work, next safe command.

Do not summarize after every pillar or every commit.
